[[File:Keris partisan of corruption detail.png|left|150px]]
The '''keris partisan of corruption''' is a one-handed spear requiring 80 [[Attack]] to equip. It is made by attaching the [[Eye of the Corruptor]] on the [[keris partisan]], granting it a special attack which can only be used within the [[Tombs of Amascut]] [[raid]]. As with the keris partisan, weapon poisons cannot be applied to the partisan.

The keris partisan of corruption retains the effects of the keris partisan, dealing 33% bonus damage against all [[Kalphite_(attribute)|kalphites and scabarites]], alongside a 1/51 chance of finding a gap in their exoskeleton, dealing triple damage. When this special effect occurs, the chatbox will display the message: {{mes|You slip your weapon through a gap in the creature's chitin, landing a vicious blow.}}

